data.outputText:
You are an expert e-commerce creative director for brands that have done $1B in revenue. You are creating Amazon A+ content 970:600 aspect ratio.

Utilise the BENEFITS list as well as the BRAND_LAYER to make an on-brand clean, Benefits infographic using short punchy sentences (non-maximalist, overly saturated AI tells), outputting the result as a JSON prompt. 

Do not output any text other than what is in the JSON output.

BENEFITS: @BENEFITS
BRAND_LAYER: {
  "aesthetic_profile": {
    "style_name": "Brazilian Tropicália & Sun-Drenched Bohemian",
    "overall_vibe": "A vibrant, sun-drenched fusion of vintage tropical leisure, rich South American cultural motifs, and bohemian architectural elements. It balances energetic, vivid street/beach life with relaxed, earthy, open-air interiors.",
    "color_palette": {
      "primary": [
        "Canary Yellow",
        "Emerald/Lush Tropical Green",
        "Vibrant Ultramarine Blue",
        "Warm Terracotta/Clay"
      ],
      "secondary": [
        "Golden Amber (Golden Hour Light)",
        "Sandy Beige",
        "Bright Cobalt Blue",
        "Vibrant Crimson/Red"
      ],
      "accents": [
        "Crisp White (mosaic contrast)",
        "Deep Mahogany Wood",
        "Citrus Orange"
      ],
      "color_grading": "Warm, highly saturated, rich contrast, reminiscent of vintage 35mm film or high-end travel editorial photography, emphasizing warm skin tones and glowing sunlight."
    },
    "lighting_and_atmosphere": {
      "time_of_day": "Midday tropical brilliance to late afternoon golden hour.",
      "light_quality": "Hard, direct sunlight creating sharp, deep shadows; dappled light filtering through lush foliage; warm, glowing ambient light filling open archways; glittering specular highlights on ocean water.",
      "atmosphere": "Breezy, humid, sun-baked, relaxed, effortlessly chic, culturally vibrant, inviting, warm."
    },
    "textures_and_materials": {
      "architectural": "Glazed ceramic mosaic tiles (azulejos, tessellated patterns, broken tile art), rough-hewn stone, raw terracotta, smooth concrete, warm varnished teak/mahogany wood.",
      "organic": "Waxy broadleaf plants (monstera, banana leaves), rough woven rattan/wicker, sandy beach grains, smooth coconut shells, glossy animal scales/shells.",
      "textiles": "Faded vintage denim, lightweight cotton, woven hammocks, retro graphic print fabrics."
    },
    "key_visual_motifs": {
      "patterns": "Copacabana wave walkways (black and white tessellation), geometric 60s/70s retro graphic prints, intricate floral/geometric ceramic tile patterns, animal prints (snakeskin, tortoise).",
      "flora_and_fauna": "Lush jungle foliage, potted indoor palm plants, hanging vines, tropical fruits (coconuts, pineapples, citrus), brightly colored bird feathers.",
      "lifestyle_elements": "Ice-cold tropical cocktails (caipirinhas) in plastic cups, casual beach games, oversized vintage sports jerseys, rustic wooden dining tables, woven pendant lamps, beach vendors, surf culture."
    },
    "architectural_style": {
      "type": "Tropical Modernism mixed with Rustic Bohemian.",
      "features": "Indoor-outdoor living, wide open archways overlooking the ocean, intricate mosaic staircases, built-in raw wood cabinetry, slatted wooden ceilings, terracotta tiled floors."
    },
    "mood_and_emotions": {
      "feelings": "Joyful, carefree, sun-kissed, nostalgic, culturally immersive, energetic yet deeply relaxing, grounded in nature.",
      "narrative": "Living a slow, beautiful life on the coast of South America, surrounded by art, nature, and endless summer."
    },
    "master_prompt_injection": "A highly detailed, sun-drenched vibrant Brazilian Tropicália aesthetic. Golden hour lighting mixed with bright midday tropical sun. Rich color palette of emerald greens, canary yellows, ultramarine blue, and warm terracotta. Textures of glazed mosaic tiles, raw mahogany wood, woven rattan, and lush broadleaf jungle foliage. Indoor-outdoor living spaces with archways overlooking the sparkling ocean. Bohemian vintage lifestyle, caipirinhas on sandy beaches, Copacabana wave patterns, retro 70s geometric prints. Shot on 35mm film, warm color grading, high saturation, nostalgic, relaxed, effortless coastal beauty, culturally rich, high aesthetic travel editorial photography."
  }
}
```

