DESMAIA CABELO (FAINTING HAIR) DETANGLING: Our high-slip conditioner provides the famous Brazilian "fainting hair" effect, instantly melting tough knots to reduce breakage. This sulfate free shampoo and conditioner alternative is safe for color-treated hair, leaving waves silky, manageable, and hydrated.
NUTRIENT COCKTAIL WITH CASTOR & COCONUT OIL: A rich blend of Castor Oil and Coconut Oil provides deep lipid replacement to seal the cuticle and combat dryness. Enhanced with Bamboo Shoot Extract, it strengthens strands and aids healthy growth retention for long-lasting definition.

