Necessary product information to recreate this with your product:

1. Product image  
A clean product image or cutout, preferably front-facing or three-quarter angle with the label visible.

2. Product category  
Needed to choose the correct supporting texture, such as cream smear, liquid splash, powder, foam, fabric, fruit, capsule scatter, etc.

3. Brand colors  
At minimum: outer background color, inner panel color, banner color, text color.

4. Three key claims or benefits  
Ideally formatted as short measurable claims, for example `24 HRS`, `40%`, `3x`, `10 MIN`, plus the supporting benefit phrase.

5. Claim substantiation text  
Required if using asterisks, percentages, clinical-style language, comparison claims, or performance metrics.

6. Top banner copy  
A short headline benefit, ideally 3 to 8 words.

7. Preferred sensory/product material cue  
Only needed if it is not obvious from the product category, for example “cream smear,” “water splash,” “powder burst,” “ingredient pile,” or “gel texture.”

